              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma y’ivyo Yesu ava i Galilaya aja mu karere kegereye igisagara ca Tiro. Nuko yinjira mu nzu kandi ntiyashaka ko hagira uwumenya ko ari ho ari; ariko ntivyakunda ko yihisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubwo nyene umugore yari afise umukobwa aboshwe n’impwemu mbi yumva ko Yesu ari ho ari. Aca araza yikubita imbere y’ibirenge vyiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo mugore yari Umugirikikazi yavukiye i Foyinike muri Siriya. Nuko yinginga Yesu ngo yirukane impwemu mbi yari mu mukobwa wiwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.26"
            ]
          }
        }
